    LLM: 'Game: Casino Sotho. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Sotho Casino is a Royal Casino variant played in Lesotho. Similar to Swazi Casino with face-up capture piles and the ability for opponents to use top cards in builds. Features numerical values for picture cards and complex building mechanics.',
    objective: 'Capture cards from the layout. First player/team to reach target score wins.',
    gameplay: "Core rules same as Swazi Casino: Captured cards kept face up in pile. Top card can be used by opponents in augmented builds. Must play exactly one card per turn. Can perform multiple build actions. Single builds (sum=value) and augmented builds (multiple sets with same value). Build owner must eventually capture. Drifting (using capturable card in build) allowed. Cannot capture directly from opponent's pile.",
